---
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
export function getStaticPaths(){return ['library','fixes','builder','workflows','checklists','learn','toolkit','access'].map(section=>({params:{section}}));}
const {section}=Astro.params;
const pages={library:['The prompt library','Find a useful starting point.','Browse all 75 topics. Three complete prompts are free to try.'],fixes:['Help me choose','What would you like to improve?','Choose a problem. We’ll suggest a focused sequence and a way to check your work.'],builder:['Customize a prompt','Make the prompt your own.','Choose an available prompt, add your context, and copy it into your AI tool.'],workflows:['Step-by-step guides','Work through a problem in order.','Work through one problem at a time. Check off each step as you finish it.'],checklists:['Review checklists','Make sure better actually works.','Review the real screen and interactions. A checked box records your review, not an automated test.'],learn:['Learn the basics','A little understanding goes a long way.','Plain-English lessons, examples, and practical ways to direct an AI tool.'],toolkit:['My saved work','Keep the useful things.','Favorites, progress, notes, and your working brief stay in this browser. Export a backup to move them.'],access:['The full edition','Go beyond the demo.','75 prompts, eight workflows, eight checklists, and the complete learning material.']};
const [eyebrow,title,description]=pages[section];
---
<Shell title={eyebrow} section={section}>{section!=='library'&&<div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/library">Prompt library</a><span aria-hidden="true"> / </span><span>{eyebrow}</span></div>}<header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">{eyebrow}</p><h1>{title}</h1><p class="lede">{description}</p></header>
{section==='library'&&<><div class="filters"><label class="search">Search prompts<input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Try spacing, navigation, or mobile"/></label><label>Topic<select id="category"><option value="">All topics</option></select></label><label>Show<select id="availability"><option value="all">All 75 prompts</option><option value="available">Available to me</option><option value="favorites">My favorites</option></select></label></div><div class="filter-status"><p class="quiet" id="results-count" role="status"></p><button class="button small" id="clear-filters">Reset filters</button></div><div id="prompt-list" class="prompt-list"><p class="loading">Loading prompts…</p></div></>}
{section==='fixes'&&<><div id="fix-list" class="two-cols"></div><section id="fix-result" class="panel" hidden tabindex="-1"></section></>}
{section==='builder'&&<div class="builder-grid"><form id="builder-form" class="panel"><p class="quiet">Fill in these four details. Your draft saves automatically in this browser.</p><label>Starting prompt<select id="template" name="template"></select></label><label>App or project name<input name="app" placeholder="e.g. My study planner" maxlength="200" required/></label><label>Screen or feature<input name="screen" placeholder="e.g. The signup screen" maxlength="300" required/></label><label>Who uses it?<input name="audience" placeholder="e.g. First-time students" maxlength="300" required/></label><label>What should they accomplish?<textarea name="goal" rows="2" maxlength="2000" placeholder="e.g. Create an account without getting confused" required></textarea></label><details class="advanced"><summary>Optional details & advanced options</summary><div><label>What feels wrong?<textarea name="issue" rows="2" maxlength="2000" placeholder="Write unknown if you need an audit"></textarea></label><label>What must stay the same?<textarea name="constraints" rows="2" maxlength="2000" placeholder="e.g. Keep the current navigation and working login"></textarea></label><label>Review mode<select name="mode"><option value="audit">Diagnose first; don’t edit yet</option><option value="implement">Implement the smallest targeted fix</option></select></label></div></details><button class="button primary" type="submit">Build my prompt</button></form><section class="panel builder-output"><p class="tiny">YOUR CUSTOMIZED PROMPT</p><h2>Your prompt will appear here.</h2><p class="quiet">This tool combines your inputs with a template. It does not call an AI model.</p><label class="sr-only" for="built-prompt">Customized prompt</label><textarea id="built-prompt" rows="20" readonly placeholder="Complete your brief to see your prompt here."></textarea><button class="button primary" id="copy-built" disabled>Copy prompt</button><p id="builder-status" class="quiet" role="status">Complete the form, then select Build my prompt.</p><details><summary>Where do I paste this?</summary><p>Paste into ChatGPT or Claude with a screenshot, or into your AI coding tool with the project open. Review its suggestions before making changes.</p><a href="/start">See the full beginner guide</a></details></section></div>}
{section==='workflows'&&<div id="workflow-list" class="stack"><p class="loading">Loading guides…</p></div>}
{section==='checklists'&&<><p id="check-progress" class="quiet" role="status"></p><div id="checklist-list" class="two-cols"></div></>}
{section==='learn'&&<div id="lesson-list" class="stack"><p class="loading">Loading lessons…</p></div>}
{section==='toolkit'&&<><div id="toolkit-stats" class="stats compact"></div><div class="two-cols"><section class="panel"><h2>Project notes</h2><label for="notes">What changed? What needs a second look?</label><textarea id="notes" rows="10" maxlength="20000" placeholder="Keep findings, decisions, and next steps here."></textarea><p class="quiet" id="notes-status" role="status">Saved on this device as you type.</p></section><section class="panel"><h2>Your backup</h2><p>Export your favorites, progress, notes, and builder inputs. Importing merges saved items and adds imported notes below your current notes.</p><p class="quiet">Access keys and full-edition content are never included. Backups can contain your private project notes.</p><div class="actions"><button id="export" class="button primary">Export backup</button><label class="button file-label">Import backup<input type="file" id="import" accept="application/json,.json"/></label></div><p id="backup-status" role="status"></p></section></div><section class="section"><h2>Saved prompts</h2><div id="favorites-list" class="prompt-list"></div></section></>}
{section==='access'&&<div class="two-cols"><section class="panel"><span class="pill">Checkout not open</span><h2>The complete playbook</h2><ul class="spacious"><li>All 75 prompts with context, expected results, and follow-ups</li><li>Eight step-by-step workflows and eight review checklists</li><li>Worked examples, modifiers, troubleshooting, and a glossary</li><li>A prompt builder and personal toolkit</li></ul><p>Purchasing and automatic delivery are not available yet. You can use the free demo today.</p><a href="/library?sample=1" class="button primary">Explore the free demo</a></section><section class="panel"><h2>Have an edition access key?</h2><p>Enter a key provided by the publisher. It unlocks the protected edition in this browser tab.</p><form id="unlock-form"><label for="access-key">Edition access key<input id="access-key" type="password" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" required/></label><button class="button primary" type="submit">Unlock full edition</button><p id="unlock-status" role="status"></p></form><button class="button" id="lock-edition" hidden>Lock this tab</button></section><section class="panel"><h2>Your data stays with you</h2><p>No account, analytics, AI API, or cloud sync is used by this app. Your notes and progress use browser storage. Clearing site data removes them; export a backup first.</p><p>Hosting providers may process ordinary request logs. The edition key stays in this tab’s session storage and is excluded from backups.</p></section><section class="panel"><h2>Using the playbook</h2><p>Share the relevant screenshot or code with your chosen AI tool. Its own privacy settings apply. Remove passwords, customer details, and confidential information before sharing.</p><p>AI suggestions still need review. Check the real user flow after making a change.</p></section></div>}
<noscript><p class="panel">Enable JavaScript to search prompts, use the builder, and save progress. The overview remains readable without it.</p></noscript>
<dialog id="prompt-dialog" aria-labelledby="dialog-title"><div class="dialog-header"><span id="dialog-category" class="tiny"></span><button id="close-dialog" class="button small">Close</button></div><div id="dialog-content"></div></dialog>
</Shell>
